            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ChemistryMama"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thanks for sharing this great replacement mixture for pumpkin pie spice. I only needed one tsp for my recipe, so I did 1/2 tsp cinnamon, 1/4 tsp allspice, 1/8 tsp ginger, and 1/8 tsp nutmeg and it was perfect!",
            "datePublished": "2021-11-25T19:50:40.960Z"
          },
          {
