            },
            "reviewBody": "Have a friend allergic to ginger so I used this recipe but substituted 2 t. ground cardamom and 1 t. ground white pepper for the ginger. Turned out really good. Thank you she hadn't had pumpkin pie since 1985.",
            "datePublished": "2024-11-28T04:11:55.121Z"
